# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Hao‐Cheng Thong et al. (2023). Machine learning interatomic potential for molecular dynamics simulation of the ferroelectric KNb O 3 perovskite.
#   Physical review. B./Physical review. B. doi:10.1103/physrevb.107.014101  arXiv:2203.01117v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2203.01117v1 (sha256 8502140d6e07527d...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 599 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/thong2023.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the single DeePMD (DeePot-SE) model of KNbO3 trained
# with DP-GEN concurrent learning over the cubic, tetragonal,
# orthorhombic and rhombohedral phases. Its training errors are given only
# as orders of magnitude, so there are no results.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-thong2023 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Thong et al. (2023): Deep Potential for molecular dynamics of ferroelectric KNbO3" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-thong2023 .

entity:article-thong2023 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1103/physrevb.107.014101> ;
    schema:datePublished "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "Machine learning interatomic potential for molecular dynamics simulation of the ferroelectric KNb O 3 perovskite" ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5973-9211> ,
