###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Training errors are stated only as orders of magnitude ('10-3~10-4 eV/atom' energy, '~10-2 eV/A' force, Sec. III A, Fig. 1b-c) and are not encoded. The data-set size is given only as 'roughly 10000'.
# - Elastic constants (mean error '~4 GPa', Tables S1-S5), polarization-switching NEB paths, domain-wall motion and phase-transition temperatures are property comparisons and are not encoded.
